      <div class="tbb-about-text">
        <p>Meet a curious little toddler with one big love — <strong>cheese!</strong> 🧀</p>
        <p>In this warm and wiggly adventure, our tiny hero discovers five very chatty cheese characters, each with their own personality, voice, and something delicious to say. From sharp cheddar to creamy brie, every page is a new friend waiting to be made.</p>
        <p>Inspired by real dinner table moments with two lively boys, <em>Tiny Bite Books</em> is a story about <strong>curiosity, siblings, and the joy of trying new things</strong> — one tiny bite at a time.</p>
