        <h3 class="tbb-author-name">Mrunal Parikh</h3>
        <p>Mrunal is a software engineer by day and a storyteller by heart. As the father of two wonderfully wild boys, he found his best story ideas right at the dinner table — in the squeals, the negotiations, and the very first brave bite of something new.</p>
        <p><em>Tiny Bite Books</em> is his debut picture book, born from countless evenings of cheesy experiments and the contagious curiosity of his sons. Mrunal believes every child has a little adventurer inside them, waiting for just the right story to wake up.</p>
        <p>When he's not writing, Mrunal works at <strong>Meta</strong>, bringing his love of detail and craft into everything he does.</p>
